{
  "id": "https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/file-type/rdf_trix",
  "type": "Concept",
  "prefLabel": {
    "es": "RDF TriX",
    "en": "RDF TriX"
  },
  "altLabel": {
    "es": [
      "Triples in XML"
    ],
    "en": [
      "Triples in XML"
    ]
  },
  "definition": {
    "es": "TriX (Triples in XML) es un formato de serialización para grafos RDF (Resource Description Framework). Es un formato XML para serializar grafos con nombre (Named Graphs) y conjuntos de datos RDF que ofrece una alternativa compacta y legible a la sintaxis RDF/XML basada en XML.",
    "en": "TriX (Triples in XML) is a serialization format for RDF (Resource Description Framework) graphs. It is an XML format for serializing Named Graphs and RDF Datasets which offers a compact and readable alternative to the XML-based RDF/XML syntax."
  },
